<attribute name="problem" nodeId="7a6ac25f">&lt;p&gt;
    The EY Survey Tool allows engagement teams to develop surveys quickly and easily without involving external survey
    providers while maintaining standard survey administration and reporting functionality.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    EY Survey Tool is available to all EY employees and can be used to create engaging online, paper, mobile, disconnected
    use, and kiosk surveys. Surveys can be created in many different languages that can be defined and translated by the
    author. The tool has powerful analysis and automated reporting functionality including benchmarking capabilities.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
